OL,3,GNEWSATwin brother developers see
OL,4,Apotential in hometown
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwin brothers and property developers
OL,7,Fsay an area that has been "getting bad
OL,8,Fpress" has "massive" untapped
OL,9,Fpotential, following their investment
OL,10,Fof almost #3m into historic buildings
OL,11,Fin the town centre.
OL,13,FJack and Tom Atha, 34, have bought
OL,14,Fthree properties in Middlesbrough's
OL,15,Fhistoric quarter for #1.4m, and plan to
OL,16,Fspend a further #1.4m developing them
OL,17,Finto offices, events and social spaces.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
