OL,3,GNEWSATwin brother developers see
OL,4,Apotential in hometown
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pair, born in Middlesbrough, plan
OL,7,Fto expand the existing business centre
OL,8,Fat Commerce House, creating a
OL,9,Fco-working space and private offices,
OL,10,Falongside a coffee shop in a
OL,11,Fneighbouring former banking hall.
OL,13,FTom Atha said "Teesside doesn't get
OL,14,Fshouted up enough", adding the pair
OL,15,Fwant to unlock its promise.
